<title>RUSSIA: Norilsk tender result due on Tuesday - Uneximbank.</title>
<headline>Norilsk tender result due on Tuesday - Uneximbank.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>A tender for 38 percent of Russia's biggest metals company Norilsk Nickel, which had been challenged by the government, will go ahead on Tuesday as planned, said commercial bank Uneximbank, which currently holds the stake.</p>
<p>&quot;Yes, the results of the tender will be known today. The results will be known at five o'clock (1300 GMT),&quot; said Uneximbank spokesman Modest Kolerov.</p>
</text>
